        <item>
            <title>3.0.1</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 00:14:06 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>20260915</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.0.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's New in v3.0.1</h2>
                <h3>New</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Montages created while on paid Firefly Cloud plans no longer have a watermark at the end.</li>
                    <li>Updated Charts on Dashboard - The winrate trend was a mostly useless line as everyone hovers around 50%, CS/M also updated to CS@10 to better track a real improvement metric as CS/M over the course of a whole game was influenced by too many game variables.</li>
                </ul>
                <h3>Enhancements</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>The Montage Builder now has buttons to easily merge clips for easier editing.</li>
                    <li>The Clip Builder now makes it more obvious that the time handles can be dragged to customize clip lengths.</li>
                    <li>Light Mode has received significant enhancements making it more readable and more visually similar to Dark and Firefly themes.</li>
                    <li>Performance improvements.</li>
                </ul>
                <h3>Bugfixes</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>macOS 27 changed how some UI elements rendered causing some visual errors and misalignments.</li>
                    <li>Montages could sometimes fail to Export with transitions applied.</li>
                    <li>Deleting multiple Firefly Cloud uploads at once could hang or take a long time to complete.</li>
                </ul>
                <p>For the full detailed changelog please visit <a href="https://fireflymac.gg/changelog.html">https://fireflymac.gg/changelog.html</a>.</p>
            ]]></description>
